<title>USA: McKesson's Healthcare to buy PMSI unit.</title>
<headline>McKesson's Healthcare to buy PMSI unit.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthcare Delivery Systems Inc, a unit of McKesson Corp, agreed to buy the Patient Programs Unit of Phoenix-based PMSI Scott-Levin, Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition, effective April 1, will add significant new business to HDS' core offerings in the design and management of patient assistance programs and alternative sampling programs for pharmaceutical and biotechnology manufacturers.</p>
</text>
